  leftText: 
  rightText: This machine aimlessly moves around utilizing a gyro mechanism located
    inside the core. This mechanism stabalizes the bot while also keeping the whole
    body rotating. Although lacking direction, their relatively low production cost
    makes these a versatile combatant fodder and crop harvester. They are however
    prone to short circuit when making contact with water.
